    {
      "repository": "gordolio/Trio",
      "number": 1810,
      "title": "Replace CryptoSwift and SwiftJWT with CryptoKit",
      "body": "Remote control used CryptoSwift to decrypt commands and SwiftJWT to sign the token for confirmation pushes. Both now use CryptoKit, which removes SwiftJWT and its six dependencies. CryptoSwift stays because OmnipodKit still uses it. LoopFollow does not need any changes. It also fixes a crash when Trio received a malformed command. Added tests to cover token signing and caching.\n",
      "labels": [],
